## What ships (daily, `./switch-model.sh deepseek`, configs/DS41-daily.json, port 8086)

- Engine `engine-v026p343-ds41`: Strata v0.2.6 + our #343 port (prompt skip across the layer split). IQ_Q8K and BORROW
