- 4060 Ti first, layers 8 / 32; 6 experts per word (5 is lossy); decay 0.8, settle 0, Engram cache 16 MB; chunk 8192;
  STRATA_DS4_PROMPT_SKIP=1; context 32K; sampling 1.0 / 0.95 / 20 / 0.05.
- Slot keep on, cap 16, 2 GB per slot; RAM store 68 GB (lowest MemAvailable 15.5 GB with everything up and 16 slots
